msgid "\nWHO ASKS -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nKES KÜSIB -- ettepanek, selle põhjal ei seadistata midagi"

msgid "  %-20s %s speaking, %s of %s sentences a question"
msgstr "  %-20s räägib %s, küsimusi: %s/%s lausest"

msgid "  The order carries, the distance between them does not: measured over four episodes it never turned round, while the distance between first and last changed fourfold. It takes one voice per track; where two of them carry the same speech nothing is said at all."
msgstr "  Järjekord peab paika, vahemaa nende vahel mitte: nelja episoodi peal mõõdetuna ei pöördunud see kunagi ümber, samal ajal kui esimese ja viimase vahe muutus neljakordselt. See eeldab üht häält raja kohta; kus kaks neist kannavad sama kõnet, ei öelda üldse midagi."

msgid "  Who asks -- not said here: two of the tracks carry the same speech, so the questions would go to whichever recorder was turned up loudest."
msgstr "  Kes küsib -- siin ei öelda: kaks rada kannavad sama kõnet, seega läheksid küsimused sellele salvestile, mis oli kõige valjemaks keeratud."

msgid "\nWHICH MICROPHONE -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nMILLINE MIKROFON -- ettepanek, selle põhjal ei seadistata midagi"

